cff-version: "1.2.0"
message: If you use this app, please cite it.
type: software
title: App Fixtures
abstract: Builds the test inputs an App Store app declares in its app.yml review block
  (generator commands, committed files or public datasets) laid out as that app reads its
  input directory, as the first step of a Pennsieve sample run.
authors:
- name: Pennsieve (University of Pennsylvania)
repository-code: https://github.com/pennsieve-apps/app-fixtures
license: Apache-2.0
version: 0.1.1
keywords:
- platform
- testing
- fixtures
- ro-crate
references:
- type: generic
  title: "RO-Crate Metadata Specification 1.1"
  url: https://w3id.org/ro/crate/1.1
- type: generic
  title: "Review inputs in app.yml (Pennsieve app-deploy-service)"
  url: https://github.com/Pennsieve/app-deploy-service/blob/main/docs/app-manifest-review.md
